<title>USA: Inter-Tel Inc Q4 net after charge falls.</title>
<headline>Inter-Tel Inc Q4 net after charge falls.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDLER, Ariz. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended	     Year Ended</p>
<p>					    Dec. 31,     Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				   1996    1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> NET SALES		  $52,500 $40,459   $185,884   $150,533</p>
<p>   Cost of sales	   29,618  23,074    104,966     87,696</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT		22,882  17,385     80,918     62,837</p>
<p> Research &amp; development   1,648   1,396	6,581	5,764</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>   administrative	  16,153  11,939     56,386     43,578</p>
<p> Special charge	  4,542(B)	--   4,542(B)   1,315(C)</p>
<p>				 22,343  13,335     67,509     50,657</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME	  539(B)   4,050  13,409(B)  12,180(C)</p>
<p> Other income		   618     622	1,974	1,674</p>
<p> Interest expense	    (34)    (14)	 (77)	(106)</p>
<p>INCOME BEFORE INCOME TAXES 1,123</p>
<p>				    (B)   4,658  15,306(B)  13,748(C)</p>
<p> INCOME TAXES		   453   1,835	6,264	5,249</p>
<p> NET INCOME		  670(B)   2,823   9,042(B)   8,499(C)</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER SHARE   0.05(B)    0.21    0.68(B)    0.71(C)</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>   shares outstanding    13,429  13,306     13,395     12,001</p>
<p>NOTES: All periods restated to reflect acquisition of Florida Telephone Systems Inc in May 1996, accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>(B) 1996 operating income includes special charge of $4,542,000, which reduced net income by $2,725,000, or $0.20 per share after tax. Charge reflects the decision by the company to replace its MIS system software. Results without charge is as follows:</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended  Year Ended</p>
<p>					     Dec. 31,	 Dec. 31,</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p>OPERATING INCOME,</p>
<p>   EXCLUDING CHARGES	    $5,081  $ 4,050 $17,951 $13,495</p>
<p>NET INCOME, EXCLUDING CHARGES</p>
<p>					 3,395    2,823  11,767   9,314</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER SHARE,</p>
<p>   EXCLUDING CHARGES		0.25     0.21    0.88    0.78</p>
<p>1995 operating income includes special charge of $1,315,000 for costs associated with integrating the operations of American Telcom Corp of Georgia, Inc and Access West Inc., which cut net income by $815,000, or $0.07 per share after tax. Operating income without charge was about $13.5 million and net income was about $9.3 million, or $.78 per share, in the year ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
